o negativo","I advised her **not to trust** one result."]],"cap":"Relato: revisão geral"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Revise: **wh- + sujeito + verbo (recuado)**, **if/whether**, **tell/ask/advise + pessoa + to**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"A student asked how we ___ test it. (can, past)","a":"could","why":"recuo."},{"s":"I asked ___ she had read earlier studies. (whether)","a":"whether","why":"sim/não."},{"s":"I told her ___ repeat it. (to)","a":"to","why":"told + to."},{"s":"I advised her not ___ trust one result. (to)","a":"to","why":"advise + not to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["research question","pergunta de pesquisa"],["testable hunch","palpite testável"],["earlier study","estudo anterior"],["experimental step","etapa experimental"],["lab notebook","caderno de laboratório"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["ask","anything","Did","he"],"ans":"Did he ask anything","pt":"Ele perguntou algo?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"testable hunch","pos":"word","pt":"palpite testável","ex":"Testable hunch.","expt":"Palpite testável."},{"w":"earlier study","pos":"word","pt":"estudo anterior","ex":"Earlier study.","expt":"Estudo anterior."},{"w":"experimental step","pos":"word","pt":"etapa experimental","ex":"Experimental step.","expt":"Etapa experimental."},{"w":"lab notebook","pos":"word","pt":"caderno de laboratório","ex":"Lab notebook.","expt":"Caderno de laboratório."},{"w":"repeat trial","pos":"word","pt":"repetição de ensaio","ex":"Repeat trial.","expt":"Repetição de ensaio."},{"w":"test variable","pos":"word","pt":"variável de teste","ex":"Test variable.","expt":"Variável de teste."},{"w":"scientific method","pos":"word","pt":"método científico","ex":"Scientific method.","expt":"Método científico."},{"w":"hy